#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>the Order of the Twin Adder</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>the Immortal Flames</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_000:1"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! I'm certain that your duties with <if ($gn52 > 0)>the Maelstrom</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>the Order of the Twin Adder</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>the Immortal Flames</if> demand much of your time already, but if I might have a word?"
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Знаю, что служба в <if ($gn52 > 0)>Мальстрёме</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Ордене Двух Змей</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Бессмертном пламени</if> и без того занимает всё ваше время, но не найдётся ли у вас минутки?"

#. ja: 現在、新設予定の「冒険者小隊」の隊長候補に、<br>お主の名前が挙がっていてな……。
#. de: Die Staatliche Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft unterhält sogenannte Kommandos, kleine Einheiten motivierter Abenteurer, die als Soldaten der Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft Einsätze von besonderer militärischer Bedeutung über<shy>nehmen.
#. fr: Laissez-moi vous expliquer. Notre grande compagnie tente depuis peu de constituer des escouades d'aventuriers dans le but d'élargir notre champ d'action. Seulement pour ça, il nous faut des chefs capables de les diriger. Vous voyez où je veux en venir<nbsp>?
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankLimsaMaleText, row = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_001:1"
msgid "I'll get right to the point, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize>. The higher-ups have authorized plans to form a specialized squad and we're on the lookout for a reliable leader. Your name was at the top of the list."
msgstr "Перейду сразу к делу, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize>. Начальство одобрило создание особого отряда, и мы ищем надёжного командира. Ваше имя оказалось первым в списке."

#. ja: 部下たちの訓練と指揮は、責任ある役割だが、<br>それだけに、さらなる昇進のチャンスでもある。<br>……この話、受けるつもりはないか？
#. de: Der Mahlstrom hat gerade ein neues Kommando gegründet und sucht einen geeigneten Anführer. Ich glaube, du würdest eine gute Figur abgeben. Was sagst du? Fühlst du dich bereit, eine Führungsposition zu über<shy>nehmen?
#. fr: Je ne vous cacherai pas qu'il s'agit d'un poste à res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>tés. Vous serez en charge de l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment et du commandement de vos subordonnés. Mais vos chances de promotion n'en seront que plus grandes<nbsp>! Le jeu en vaut la chandelle, vous ne pensez pas<nbsp>?
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankLimsaMaleText, row = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_002:1"
msgid "You would be responsible for training and commanding a number of adventurer subordinates, and the position also comes with the possibility of further promotion. What say you, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize>? Are you ready to lead?"
msgstr "Вам предстоит обучать и командовать отрядом искателей приключений. Должность ответственная, зато открывает путь к дальнейшему повышению. Ну что скажете, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize>? Готовы командовать?"

#. ja: 冒険者小隊の隊長になる？
#. de: Bist du bereit, die Führung über ein Kommando zu über<shy>nehmen?
#. fr: Souhaitez-vous devenir chef d'escouade de grande compagnie<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "Become a squadron commander?"
msgstr "Стать командиром отряда?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"

#. ja: そうか……残念だが、仕方あるまい。<br>覚悟のない者に、兵たちの命を預けるわけにはいかないからな。
#. de: Nein? Na, ich bin mir sicher, dass du deine Gründe hast. Das Angebot aber gilt. Also melde dich wieder, wenn du bereit bist!
#. fr: Je comprends... La vie d'hommes et de femmes est un bien lourd fardeau à endosser. Si vous ne vous sentez pas capable d'assumer une telle pression, mieux vaut confier cette mission à quelqu'un d'autre.
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_005:1"
msgid "Ah. Well, that's not the response I was hoping for, but it's best we're all honest here. A hesitant commander is a danger to <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> own troops."
msgstr "Вот как... Жаль, но ничего не поделаешь. Нельзя доверять жизни солдат командиру, который сам не уверен в себе."

#. ja: おぉ、それは良かった！<br>それでは早速だが、お主の補佐を担当する下士を、<br>この場に呼び寄せるとしよう！
#. de: Verantwortungsvoll, wie man dich kennt! Der Mahlstrom wird dir einen Sturmmaat zur Seite stellen, um dir deine neue Aufgabe zu erklären. Da ist er ja!
#. fr: À la bonne heure<nbsp>! Ne vous inquiétez pas, vous ne serez pas <if $gn4>seule<else>seul</if> face à vos res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>tés. Tenez, voilà votre adjoint qui arrive<nbsp>!
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_006:1"
msgid "Outstanding! Let's get you acquainted with your second-in-command right away."
msgstr "Прекрасно! Позвольте сразу познакомить вас с вашим заместителем."

#. ja: お初にお目に掛かります、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>小隊長殿！<br>小官が小隊長殿の補佐を担当させていただく、<br><if ($gn52 > 0)>小隊付甲軍曹</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>小隊付牙軍曹</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>小隊付闘軍曹</if>であります！
#. de: Kommandoführer<if $gn4>in</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>? Ich stehe dir zu Diensten!
#. fr: Honoré de faire votre con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if></capitalize><nbsp>! C'est moi qui aurai le privilège de vous seconder dans votre nouveau poste de chef d'escouade. Vous pouvez m'appeler Sergent<nbsp>!
#. speaker: PLATOONINSTRUCTOR
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankLimsaMaleText, row = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_PLATOONINSTRUCTOR_000_007:1"
msgid "It's an honor to be serving with you, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! In my capacity as your aide, I'll be filling the role of squadron sergeant."
msgstr "Для меня честь служить с вами, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Я буду вашим помощником и сержантом отряда."

#. ja: そしてこちらが……<br>栄えある我が小隊に所属する兵たちです！
#. de: Lass mich dir unsere Soldaten vorstellen. Drei mutige Abenteurer und Aben<shy>teu<shy>re<shy>rin<shy>nen, die sich in den Dienst unserer Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft gestellt haben.
#. fr: Et maintenant, laissez-moi vous présenter les valeureux soldats qui seront sous vos ordres<nbsp>!
#. speaker: PLATOONINSTRUCTOR
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_PLATOONINSTRUCTOR_000_008:1"
msgid "And these eager troopers are the inaugural members of our squadron. Form up!"
msgstr "А вот и новобранцы нашего отряда! Смирно!"

#. ja: いずれも英雄たる小隊長殿に憧れて、<br><if ($gn52 > 0)>黒渦団</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>双蛇党</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>不滅隊</if>に志願してきた冒険者出身の新兵たちです。<br>以後、よろしくお願いいたします！
#. de: Alles gute Leute, von mir eigens für dieses Kommando ausgesucht. Du wirst sehen: Sie sind hochmotiviert!
#. fr: Vos exploits au sein <if ($gn52 > 0)>du Maelstrom</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>des Immortels</if> ont fait des émules<nbsp>: ces nouvelles recrues nous ont toutes rejoints par admiration pour votre personne. Vous êtes leur idole, alors tâchez de ne pas les décevoir<nbsp>!
#. speaker: PLATOONINSTRUCTOR
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_PLATOONINSTRUCTOR_000_009:1"
msgid "Every one of them is a fledgling adventurer who enlisted in the hopes of following in your legendary footsteps. They're green to the military, aye, but we'll harden them up soon enough."
msgstr "Все они — молодые искатели приключений, добровольно вступившие в <if ($gn52 > 0)>Водоворот</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Орден Двух Змей</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Бессмертное пламя</if>, чтобы идти по вашим легендарным стопам. В армии они пока новички, но мы быстро их закалим."

#. ja: それでは、実際の訓練や任務については、<br>我らが隊に割り当てられた兵舎にて、<br>詳しく説明させていただきましょう！
#. de: So viel zur Begrüßung. Alles Weitere können wir drinnen besprechen. Wir warten gleich hier in der Wachstube <if ($gn52 > 0)>des Mahlstroms</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>der Bruderschaft</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>der Legion</if> auf dich.
#. fr: Je vais vous expliquer en détail en quoi consiste au quotidien votre rôle de chef d'escouade. Mais avant cela, pourquoi ne pas rejoindre la caserne que notre grande compagnie nous a généreusement allouée<nbsp>?
#. speaker: PLATOONINSTRUCTOR
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_PLATOONINSTRUCTOR_000_010:1"
msgid "When you've a moment to spare, stop by the barracks and we can discuss their training and deployment in greater detail."
msgstr "Как будет свободная минутка, загляните в казармы. Там подробно обсудим подготовку отряда и его задания."

#. ja: 我々は、先に兵舎に赴き、待機しております。<br>では、失礼致します！
#. de: Also gut. Abtreten!
#. fr: Nous allons prendre les devants et vous y attendre.
#. speaker: PLATOONINSTRUCTOR
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_PLATOONINSTRUCTOR_000_011:1"
msgid "I'll leave you to it, then, Commander."
msgstr "Тогда оставлю вас, командир."

#. ja: どうだ？<br>なかなかに頼もしそうな連中だろう？<br>今から、お主の小隊がどんな活躍をするのか楽しみだ！
#. de: Was denkst du? Die sahen doch alle ganz brauchbar aus. Ich bin mir sicher, du wirst sie zu einer regelrechten Eliteeinheit formen.
#. fr: Alors, quelle impression vous ont laissée vos hommes<nbsp>? Per<shy>son<shy>nel<shy>le<shy>ment, je trouve qu'ils ont l'air de soldats tout à fait compétents. J'ai hâte de les voir à l'œuvre<nbsp>!
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_012:1"
msgid "What do you think? I'll admit they're raw as soldiers go, but they certainly have potential. I look forward to seeing what you can do with them."
msgstr "Что думаете? Солдатского опыта у них, конечно, маловато, но задатки есть. Не терпится посмотреть, чего вы вместе добьётесь."

#. ja: ここ「<if ($gn52 > 0)>黒渦団：軍令部</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>双蛇党：統合司令部</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>不滅隊：作戦本部</if>」の奥にある扉から、<br>兵舎に向かうことができるので、利用するといい。
#. de: Du weißt doch, wo die Wachstube ist, oder? Es ist die Tür gleich links vom Schalter. Geh nur rein, dein neues Kommando erwartet dich.
#. fr: La porte située au fond du quartier général vous mènera à la caserne de votre escouade.
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>command room</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>Adders' Nest</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>Hall of Flames</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_013:1"
msgid "Right, I won't keep you any longer. Your squad's barracks can be found through the door at the back of the <if ($gn52 > 0)>command room</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Hall of Flames</if>."
msgstr "За этой дверью, в глубине <if ($gn52 > 0)>командного пункта</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Гнезда гадюк</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Зала Пламени</if>, находятся казармы вашего отряда."

#. ja: お主の小隊に<if ($gn52 > 0)>海神リムレーン</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>地神ノフィカ</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>商神ナルザル</if>の祝福あらんことを！
#. de: Möge <if ($gn52 > 0)>Llymlaen eure Segel mit Wind füllen</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Nophica euch sicher geleiten</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Nald'thal über dich und die deinen wachen</if>!
#. fr: Puisse <if ($gn52 > 0)>Llymlaen</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Nophica</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Nald'thal</if> couronner vos entreprises de succès<nbsp>!
#. speaker: STORMPERSONNEL
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>the Navigator guide you to victory</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>the Matron watch over you</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>Nald'thal bless you with fortune</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_STORMPERSONNEL_000_014:1"
msgid "May <if ($gn52 > 0)>the Navigator guide you to victory</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>the Matron watch over you</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Nald'thal bless you with fortune</if>!"
msgstr "Пусть <if ($gn52 > 0)>Покровительница мореплавателей приведёт вас к победе</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Мать-земля хранит вас</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Налд'тал дарует вам удачу</if>!"

#. ja: 「冒険者小隊」が開放されました！<br>「<if ($gn52 > 0)>黒渦団兵舎</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>双蛇党兵舎</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>不滅隊兵舎</if>」への入室が可能になりました。<br>兵舎内の<if ($gn52 > 0)>小隊付甲軍曹</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>小隊付牙軍曹</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>小隊付闘軍曹</if>に話しかけ、小隊の管理をしてみましょう！
#. de: Du hast die Führung über ein Kommando übernommen. Betritt die Wachstube <if ($gn52 > 0)>des Mahlstroms</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>der Bruderschaft</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>der Legion</if> und sprich mit dem <if ($gn52 > 0)>Sturmmaat</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Schlangenjünger</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Legionsgefreiten</if>, um die Arbeit mit deinen Soldaten zu beginnen.
#. fr: Vous êtes désormais à la tête d'une escouade de grande compagnie.<br>Pour envoyer les hommes qui la composent en mission ou les entraîner, accédez à la caserne qui se trouve au sein du quartier général <if ($gn52 > 0)>du Maelstrom</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>des Immortels</if>.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>Twin Adder</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>Flame</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/023/ComLim101_02390:TEXT_COMLIM101_02390_SYSTEM_000_015:1"
msgid "You are now the commander of an adventurer squadron!<br>Enter the <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Twin Adder</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Flame</if> Barracks and speak with your squadron sergeant to issue deployment orders."
msgstr "Теперь вы командуете отрядом искателей приключений!<br>Зайдите в казармы <if ($gn52 > 0)>Водоворота</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Ордена Двух Змей</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Пламени</if> и поговорите с сержантом, чтобы отдавать приказы об отправке отряда."
